OL,3,ABig Brother fans still not happy as
OL,4,Ahousemate called out on behaviour
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Big Brother housemate who prompted
OL,7,Fmore than 7,000 complaints has been
OL,8,Fspoken to about his on-screen behaviour
OL,9,F- but some fans say the show's not
OL,10,Fdoing enough.
OL,12,FViewers and women's safety charities
OL,13,Fhad been calling on ITV to intervene in
OL,14,FOmar El Mayer and Rhianna Collins'
OL,15,Frelationship after several heated
OL,16,Fexchanges between the pair.
OL,18,FHe was called into Big Brother's Diary
OL,19,FRoom during Wednesday's episode and
OL,20,Ftold his language and behaviour "could
OL,21,Fcause offence". He denied dismissing
OL,22,FRhianna's feelings.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
