OL,3,ABig Brother fans still not happy as
OL,4,Ahousemate called out on behaviour
OL,5,
OL,6,FITV has been contacted for comment. The
OL,7,Fbroadcaster previously said "welfare
OL,8,Fand safeguarding are prioritised
OL,9,Fthroughout the production".
